  "description": "A Mandelbulb raymarched at speed: the exponent morphs under bass, orbit-trap colour races through a psychedelic spectrum, and a greebled ridge shell carves micro-detail. The cursor orbits the camera, holding dollies in, and clicks fire shock rings. Escape-time strata terrace the surface, lobes cast soft shadows and light shafts, and ring traps keyed to bass, mids and treble engrave glowing filigree.",
